# Cloudflare Workers static-asset headers (W7 plan Step 7). No Cache-Control on /*: a header that
# two rules set is comma-joined, which would corrupt the immutable rule below. HTML keeps the
# platform default, public, max-age=0, must-revalidate.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY

/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/favicon.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
